## Room 56. LOOK.BAS 5600 and 5650.

create the Space Warp Enterance
  a room
  room name:
    Space warp enterance
  exits, one-way: north to the City, northeast to the Square Room, in to the Square Room

  You are at the south edge of the city. On your south is a{br}
  space warp, used for instant transportation in the city long ago.

## Room 57. LOOK.BAS 5700 and 5750.

create the Vault of City
  a room
  room name:
    Vault of city
  exits, one-way: east to the City, south to the Square Room

  You are standing south of the vault of the ancient city, which{br}
  contains it's most valuable treasure. written on the vault:{br}
  "This vault is designed to keep out all human intruders.{br}
  anyone who attemps to open it will be immediately removed."

